.TH LREMOVEXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
lremovexattr \- removes an extended attribute without following the final symbolic link
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B int lremovexattr(const char* path, const char* name);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes an extended attribute without following the final symbolic link.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lremovexattr (2)
